t has taken place or is taking place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73221&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:73221:3","headword":"현지","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"일을 실제로 진행하거나 작업하는 곳.","englishExpression":"field; site","englishDescription":"A place where a certain activity is taking place or a task is in progress.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73221&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:80423:1","headword":"터전","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"집터가 되는 땅.","englishExpression":"lot; site","englishDescription":"Ground suitable for building a house.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80423&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:81658:2","headword":"소재","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 건물 등이 자리 잡고 있는 곳.","englishExpression":"location; site","englishDescription":"&quot;the place where a building, etc., is located. &quot;","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81658&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:81660:1","headword":"소재지","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 건물 등이 자리 잡고 있는 곳.","englishExpression":"location; site","englishDescription":"The place where a building, etc., is located.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81660&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:86877:2","headword":"현장","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"일이 벌어졌거나 벌어지고 있는 곳.","englishExpression":"scene; site","englishDescription":"A place where an event has taken place or is taking place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86877&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:86877:3","headword":"현장","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"일을 실제로 진행하거나 작업하는 곳.","englishExpression":"field; site","englishDescription":"A place where a certain activity is taking place or a task is in progress.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86877&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91148:1","headword":"터","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"건물을 지었거나 지을 자리.","englishExpression":"lot; site","englishDescription":"A site where a building was built or will be built.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91148&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91148:4","headword":"터","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"‘자리’나 ‘장소’의 뜻을 나타내는 말.","englishExpression":"site; spot; place","englishDescription":"A word meaning a spot or place.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91148&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}]}}
